        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BSE100FAL, Offset 1\" Square Wood Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOne of today's hottest trends is adding natural touches to modern decor. The 1 Inch Offset Square Solid Wood Door Pull features a contemporary shape with a solid wood grip. This door handle is unfinished, allowing the natural beauty of the wood to shine through. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths. The offset wrap around square mounts are available in a huge selection of finishes. If you haven't guessed yet, this First Impressions Offset Solid Wood Square Pull is almost totally customizable because each one is handmade right here in the USA. If you don't see a finish color, wood type, or size you would like please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Modern Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-cmbw.pdf?v=1704262249\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BSE01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262337\"><b>First Impressions BSE100FAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BSE100012FAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.01\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BSE100024FAL</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.01\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BSE100036FAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3.19\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2.01\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "1 Inch Offset Square Solid Wood Door Pull",
